context:
DELETE /wiki/api/v2/folders/{id}
Delete a folder by id. Deleting a folder moves the folder to the trash, where it can be restored later **[Permissions](https://confluence.atlassian.com/x/_AozKw) required**: Permission to view the folder and its corresponding space. Permission to delete folders in the space.
Required: id (path) — The ID of the folder to be deleted.

DELETE /wiki/api/v2/folders/{folder-id}/properties/{property-id}
Deletes a content property for a folder by its id. **[Permissions](https://confluence.atlassian.com/x/_AozKw) required**: Permission to edit the folder.
Required: folder-id (path) — The ID of the folder the property belongs to.; property-id (path) — The ID of the property to be deleted.

GET /wiki/api/v2/folders/{folder-id}/properties/{property-id}
Retrieves a specific Content Property by ID that is attached to a specified folder. **[Permissions](https://confluence.atlassian.com/x/_AozKw) required**: Permission to view the folder.
Required: folder-id (path) — The ID of the folder for which content properties should be returned.; property-id (path) — The ID of the content property being requested.

PUT /wiki/api/v2/folders/{folder-id}/properties/{property-id}
Update a content property for a folder by its id. **[Permissions](https://confluence.atlassian.com/x/_AozKw) required**: Permission to edit the folder.
Required: folder-id (path) — The ID of the folder the property belongs to.; property-id (path) — The ID of the property to be updated.; body (body) — The content property to be updated.
